---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout pageTitle="Sensations">
    <article class="story">
        <h1>Common flora</h1>
        <p>
            Their purple tones bleed into a false canopy of soft, yielding leaves, and below them, these fruits hard and unyielding and as dark and lustrous as lacquer, midnight. <i>Wild eggplants.</i>
        </p>
        <p>Pink and slight, like painted shadows. <i>Oleanders.</i></p>
        <p>A seam pulled loose from a velvet dress then curled tight like a screw, rich and fragrant with the sweet magenta of crushed berries. <i>Coxcombs.</i></p>
        <p>Level ground. <i>Plane trees.</i></p>
        <p>Large heavy like feathers of geese in broad daylight turning under human touch into shadows damp and seeping into a purple blush. <i>Magnolia.</i></p>
    </article>

    <style>
        .story {
            width: 10rem;
            max-width: 90%;
            margin: 4rem auto;
            color: #847f5a;
        }

        h1 {
            margin-bottom: 1em;
            color: #9f6049;
        }
    </style>
</BaseLayout>